{"id":"komandir","lemma":"командир","pos":"noun","rank":1291,"glosses":["commander, commanding officer","boss, chief, Cap (term of address to a man)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/80/Ru-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B4%D0%B8%D1%80.ogg/Ru-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B4%D0%B8%D1%80.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"командира","plural":"командиры"},"examples":[{"text":"Я не твой командир.","en":"I'm not your commanding officer.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Я всё ещё ваш командир.","en":"I'm still your commanding officer.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,{"g":"your, yours"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"still, yet, as yet"]]},{"text":"Говорит командир корабля.","en":"This is the captain speaking.","words":[{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},null,{"g":"ship, liner","l":"корабль"}]},{"text":"Я не ваш командир.","en":"I'm not your commanding officer.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"your, yours"},null]},{"text":"Я не могу игнорировать приказы своего командира.","en":"I can't ignore my commanding officer's orders.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to ignore"},{"g":"order","l":"приказ"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},null]}]}